#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:361
msgid ""
"The Default Country Code is used to format numbers that don't include an "
"international prefix (e.g., +358).\n"
"\n"
"If left empty, the system tries to detect it automatically from your SIM "
"card or network.\n"
"\n"
"You can manually override it here by entering a 2-letter ISO region code (e."
"g. US, FI, DE) or a calling code (e.g. +358, 358, +1, 1)."
msgstr ""
"Tetã Código Por defecto ojepuru oñemboheko hag̃ua papapy ndoikéiva peteĩ "
"ñe’ẽpehẽtai internacional (e.g., +358).\n"
"\n"
"Ojehejáramo nandi, sistema oñeha’ã ohechakuaa ijeheguiete nde tarjeta SIM "
"térã red-gui.\n"
"\n"
"Ikatu embogue nde po rupive ko’ápe eikévo peteĩ código región ISO 2 tai "
"rehegua (e.g. US, FI, DE) térã peteĩ código ohenóiva (e.g. +358, 358, +1, 1)."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:382
msgid ""
"The ringback tone is the sound played (toot-toot-toot) while waiting for an "
"outgoing call to be answered. Some carriers don't generate it so we have "
"option to generate it manually here. \n"
"\n"
"You can select your own music file, or clear it to use the standard system "
"tone."
msgstr ""
"Pe tono de timbre haꞌehína pe tyapu oñembopúva (toot-toot-toot) oñehaꞌarõ "
"aja oñembohovái peteĩ ñehenói osẽva. Oĩ portador ndogeneráiva upévare "
"roguereko opción rogenera haĝua manualmente ko’ápe. \n"
"\n"
"Ikatu eiporavo ne rembiapokue purahéi rehegua, térã emopotĩ eipuru hag̃ua "
"sistema tono estándar."

